Package: intstatgui
Title: Data From Eurostat and the OECD With a Graphical Interface and RStudio Addin
Version: 0.6.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Christian", "Lindell", , "christian_lindell@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Peter", "Möller", , "larspetermoller@gmail.com", role = "ctb",
           comment = "pxweb2rgui, which the interface is based on")
  )
Description: A Shiny interface, also available as an RStudio and Positron
    addin, for fetching data from Eurostat and the OECD. Browse or search
    the tables, choose variables and values, and get ready-made R code or
    download the data as txt, Excel or parquet. Builds on the 'eurostat' and
    'OECDdata' packages. Handles labels and code columns and splitting of
    very large Eurostat requests.
